## LabelsApi

### Apply label to entity
## Apply label to entity
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/labels/{{label_id}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "entity_ids": "<string>"
}


### Create labels
## Create labels
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "labels": "<string>"
}


### List labels
## List labels
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/labels?campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&labelIds={{labelIds}}&entityStatuses={{entityStatuses}}&labelTypes={{labelTypes}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Remove label from entities
## Remove label from entities
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/labels/{{label_id}}/remove
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "entity_ids": "<string>"
}


### Update labels
## Update labels
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "labels": "<string>"
}

